 "words": 168,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I pray not for these alone today",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But for those who will believe",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the word that they convey",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Into the world to receive",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As you the Father are in me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I am in you likewise",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let them be in us, we sing",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In this holy, quiet space",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That they may all be one",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As we are one, as we are one",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the world believe it is done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That you sent me, and this is won",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The glory you gave to me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have given to them all",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That they may be complete and free",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In truth and in the call",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That they may all be one",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As we are one, as we are one",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the world believe it is done",
   "heard": 7,
